"lines":[{"speaker":"Scarlet","text":"I read the books so that you do not have to. Some of what is in them burns."}],"choices":[{"text":"Come with us.","detail":"They join the party: four at most.","effects":[{"kind":"joinParty","companion":"scarlet","figure":"scarlet-figure"}]},{"text":"Not yet."}]}]},{"id":"camp-arty","start":"met","nodes":[{"id":"met","lines":[{"text":"Arty looks up from the fire."},{"speaker":"Arty","text":"Going somewhere? I have been everywhere, near enough. Somewhere new would make a change."}],"choices":[{"text":"Come with us.","detail":"They join the party: four at most.","effects":[{"kind":"joinParty","companion":"arty","figure":"arty-figure"}]},{"text":"What can you do?","goto":"can"},{"text":"Not yet."}]},{"id":"can","lines":[{"speaker":"Arty","text":"Point me at it. It will be down before it is close enough to bother you."}],"choices":[{"text":"Come with us.","detail":"They join the party: four at most.","effects":[{"kind":"joinParty","companion":"arty","figure":"arty-figure"}]},{"text":"Not yet."}]}]},{"id":"camp-pint","start":"met","nodes":[{"id":"met","lines":[{"text":"Pint looks up from the fire."},{"speaker":"Pint","text":"Somebody ought to go with you who knows how to close a wound. It might as well be me."}],"choices":[{"text":"Come with us.","detail":"They join the party: four at most.","effects":[{"kind":"joinParty","companion":"pint","figure":"pint-figure"}]},{"text":"What can you do?","goto":"can"},{"text":"Not yet."}]},{"id":"can","lines":[{"speaker":"Pint","text":"I keep people breathing. And I carry an axe, for the things that would rather they did not."}],"choices":[{"text":"Come with us.","detail":"They join the party: four at most.","effects":[{"kind":"joinParty","companion":"pint","figure":"pint-figure"}]},{"text":"Not yet."}]}]},{"id":"camp-ganja","start":"met","nodes":[{"id":"met","lines":[{"text":"Ganja looks up from the fire."},{"speaker":"Ganja","text":"You smell like a fight that has not happened yet. I would lik